      "curator_note": "Cross-linked MØD variables: IMS_4_24_1, IMS_4_24_2. MISMATCH - neither encodes the drawn C-Cl inductive cleavage to C4H9+ + •Cl. IMS_4_24_1 '...>>[C+]1[C]2[C]3[C]4.[H]5[Cl+.]6' encodes HCl loss and IMS_4_24_2 '...>>[C+]1([C]2)([C]3).[C]4[H]5[Cl+.]6' encodes CH2Cl loss to C3H7+; BOTH retain chlorine as [Cl+.] on the product side, giving a doubly-charged (+2) right-hand side that is charge-non-conserving."
